  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 302.11 Scope of Master Plumber License. An individual who meets the qualifications as a master plumber shall be deemed to be qualified as a journeyman plumber.\n\nSource. #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.12)",
